{"thread":{"threadID":2896,"boardID":166,"topic":"Ping Grenze","time":1440703760,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","lastPostTime":1441129201,"lastPoster":"Pixel","replies":18,"views":914,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":35924,"threadID":2896,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","subject":"Ping Grenze","time":1440703760,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1772,"username":"KAMIKAZE","time":1440704010,"value":1},{"userID":1872,"username":"idk","time":1440726600,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1440771082,"value":1},{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775178,"value":1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1440712775,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hellö my friends</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich finde wir sollten auf allen Servern eine Ping Grenze einführen zwischen 100-150, man kann manchmal einfach nicht normal spielen. Auf dem Knife zum beispiel ist es oft so, dass die Player sich hin und her teleportieren und man sie halt einfach nicht trift was dann denn ganzen Spielspaß versaut.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Der Vorschlag gilt für alle Server.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MFG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Rape/Benni</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35925,"threadID":2896,"userID":9,"username":"TodesKeKs","subject":"","time":1440704385,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775182,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[dafuer*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35927,"threadID":2896,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1440705167,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775186,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Einen Auto-Kick bei einem Ping von 150-200 würde ich gut finden.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35928,"threadID":2896,"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","subject":"","time":1440705195,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775198,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[nichtgut*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35929,"threadID":2896,"userID":9,"username":"TodesKeKs","subject":"","time":1440705234,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775202,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[schaemdich*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35930,"threadID":2896,"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","subject":"","time":1440705403,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775210,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[sonicht*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35931,"threadID":2896,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1440708142,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1440712791,"value":1},{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775224,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>die meisten die nicht aus Deutschland kommen haben halt einen 100-300 ping. Wir würden so mit dem autokick mindestens 60% der Spieler verlieren. Ich sehe auf SurfDM, Knife, Minigame, Course fadt nur Spieler mit Ping von + 100.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bin dagegen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35934,"threadID":2896,"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","subject":"","time":1440712857,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1440717905,"value":1},{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775236,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sehe es auch so wie Craxto....sind halt viele Ausländische Spieler auf den Servern...muss man sich halt dran gewöhnen. Und als guter Spieler sollte es einem nicht besonders Schwerfallen sich auf so etwas einzustellen <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35935,"threadID":2896,"userID":1943,"username":"TheRealSouldex","subject":"","time":1440714717,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775240,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>naja wenn du nur für 5 sek. So ein Pinguin hast ist es auch blöd da du dann wieder nachjoinen müsstest</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35943,"threadID":2896,"userID":1836,"username":"ApicNexie","subject":"","time":1440726380,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1430,"username":"mar1o :)","time":1440755597,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1440771141,"value":1},{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775244,"value":1},{"userID":1872,"username":"idk","time":1440726590,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>TheRealSouldex</strong></cite><p>naja wenn du nur für 5 sek. So ein Pinguin hast ist es auch blöd da du dann wieder nachjoinen müsstest<br></p></blockquote><p>Pinguin? Hier bin ich!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35950,"threadID":2896,"userID":1430,"username":"mar1o :)","subject":"","time":1440755623,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","time":1440775253,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Immer dieser Pinguin <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35972,"threadID":2896,"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","subject":"","time":1440775284,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1445,"username":"Marxn","time":1440775371,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[google]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35973,"threadID":2896,"userID":1865,"username":"epixplay","subject":"","time":1440775665,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Also das mit der Ping grenze ist etwas übertrieben ich meine Leute könne manchmal selbst nichts dafür das sie so einen hohen Ping haben ich mein man könnte sie fragen ob sie da etwas ändern können aber das sie sofort gekickt werden  <span class=\"missing-media\">[?(]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":35983,"threadID":2896,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1440776965,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bei einen Ping von 300 laggt man doch selbst und für einen teleportieren alle Spieler in der Gegend rum.<br>Wenn ich manchmal solchen Ping habe, ist es unspielerbar für mich und ich gehe vom Server (oder in den spectate um meine Adminpflichten zu erfüllen) und mache irgendetwas anderes, außer CS.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wie kann es denn für Leute mit so einem hohen Ping Spaß machen?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36060,"threadID":2896,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1440848626,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es würden dadurch einige Spieler verloren gehen.<br>Der Knife-Server besteht eher aus anderen Ländern als Deutschland, wie andere erwähnt haben haben diese selbstverständlich einen etwas höheren Ping. Eine Grenze ab 250~ wäre vielleicht plausibel aber es gibt einige die es als standard sehen wenn Sie einen Ping von 180~ haben, manchmal macht dies auch nicht viel aus und der Spielverlauf wird nicht behindert durch solche Pings.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36077,"threadID":2896,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","subject":"","time":1440852204,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1440853222,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dann mach wenigsten eine grenze ab 300-500 das hat dann nichts mehr mit Ausland zutun sonder einfach nur das das Internet abkackt. Das würde schon etwas helfen weil gegen die Leute kann man dann echt nix mehr machen die sich nur hin und her teleportieren.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36080,"threadID":2896,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1440853828,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Fänd ich auch gut so ab 300, das sie dann halt früher time outen^^</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36236,"threadID":2896,"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","subject":"","time":1441123378,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das wär nicht so schön da ich manchmal auch einen erhöhten Ping habe wen mein Bruder , wie ich mir denke , Pornos zieht^^. Aber meiner Meinung nach 300 Grenze kann man wohl machen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36247,"threadID":2896,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1441129201,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1441129297,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Falls die Möglichkeit besteht, wäre ich für einen move zu den Specs wenn man x Sekunden einen erhöhten Ping hat.</p>","polls":[]}]}